The Edimax is an AC1200 Wall-Wart access point. It has 1 Gigabit Ethernet port and 2 external antennas. It is now also sold under the name Edimax Gemini RE11 as a pair of range extenders and as RE11S as as a single range extender. The firmware for the EW-7478AP can be flashed also onto these devices, see the installation instructions below. The device is also compatible with the [[toh:hwdata:edimax:edimax_ew-7476rpc|EW-7476RPC]], which has internal instead of the external antennas.

